      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const item = $input.first().json;\nconst shortId = (item.id || 'post').split('-')[0];\nconst cleanName = item.topic\n  .toLowerCase()\n  .normalize('NFD').replace(/[\\u0300-\\u036f]/g, '')\n  .replace(/[^a-z0-9]/g, '-')\n  .replace(/-+/g, '-')\n  .replace(/^-|-$/g, '');\nconst repoName = `ai-${cleanName.substring(0, 25)}-${shortId}`.replace(/^-|-$/g, '');\nconst readmeText = `# ${item.topic}\n\n${item.linkedin_caption}\n\n---\n\n### 📄 Download do Carrossel em PDF\n👉 [Baixar Carrossel PDF completo](${item.pdf_url})\n\n---\n*Gerado automaticamente pela Content Factory de IA de @__icarofernandes*`;\nconst b64Content = Buffer.from(readmeText).toString('base64');\nreturn [{ json: { repo_name: repoName, topic: item.topic, caption: item.linkedin_caption, pdf_url: item.pdf_url, post_id: item.id, b64_content: b64Content } }];"
      },
